WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.797 --> 00:00:17.380
(upbeat music)

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.260
- [Narrator] Rehana's
husband left three years ago,

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.340
leaving her and her kids
without a way to earn money.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.670
A leg injury prevents her from most work,

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.610
so, she joined the men on the roads.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.950
She didn't have money for a rickshaw,

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.760
but a dealer helped her out.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.880
Once she got the vehicle,
her son climbed in

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.855
to help her with
directions and, one by one,

00:00:54.855 --> 00:00:57.320
people started asking for rides.

